# console transcripts from run_sweep.sh — regenerable, and the authoritative
# record is raw/results-*.json (committed). kept out so reruns don't churn diffs
sweep.log
sweep-t1-*.log

# logs/ is deliberately NOT ignored. run_all.jl captures the verify probes'
# output there because sending it to devnull destroyed the findings those
# probes exist to produce; every raw/results-*.json records a `log` path into
# it and results.md points readers at it. ignoring the directory would leave
# those references dangling for anyone who clones. ~40 KB total.
